# The end of chapter one. Duilio signs, takes his papers and goes; the bar
# empties; and the thing that leaves is not the building.
#
# Hung on the bar door rather than on the conversation, because a sequence
# cannot be started from a dialogue option and because walking out is what the
# player will do next anyway. The door is locked from the moment the papers are
# witnessed, so Vai plays this instead of moving anybody.

uid baggaseqend001

say   SEQ_END_1
say   SEQ_END_2
flag  duilio_gone
wait  0.6
sound thud
say   SEQ_END_3
say   SEQ_END_4
sound hum_low
say   SEQ_END_5
flag  chapter1_done
say   SEQ_END_6
